<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-img-col">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Andrea Villas-Boas Finkelstein â€” Founder of Vivazia Living">
    
    <div style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:120px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,var(--cream));pointer-events:none;z-index:2"></div><div class="about-badge"><span class="about-badge-num">15+</span><span class="about-badge-text">Years Leading</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="about-text">
    <span class="section-eyebrow fade in">The Founder</span>
    <h2 class="section-title fade in">Brazilian-born.<br>Charleston-rooted.<br><em>Globally minded.</em></h2>
    <div class="rule fade in"></div>
    <div class="fade in">
      <p>I am Andrea Villas-Boas Finkelstein â€” Executive Director, trilingual interpreter, marketing strategist, and the woman behind Vivazia Living. My journey began in the vibrant culture of Brazil, wound through two decades of professional leadership, and found its home here in Charleston, SC.</p>
      <blockquote class="about-pull">"Vivazia represents more than expertise â€” it is a testament to a shared dream of living fully, beautifully, and intentionally."</blockquote>
      <p>With over <strong>20 years spanning executive leadership, multilingual communications, HR, operations, and marketing</strong>, I bring a rare breadth of expertise to every engagement. Whether working with corporate teams, individual women in transition, or business owners ready to grow â€” I show up with strategy, warmth, and a deeply Brazilian sense of abundance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-tags fade in">
      <span class="about-tag">Executive Director</span>
      <span class="about-tag">Trilingual</span>
      <span class="about-tag">Brazilian-born</span>
      <span class="about-tag">Charleston, SC</span>
      <span class="about-tag">Marketing Expert</span>
      <span class="about-tag">Interpreter</span>
      <span class="about-tag">Women's Empowerment</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- CONNECTION STRIP -->
