<section style="position:relative;min-height:500px;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden" id="philosophy">
  <img style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;display:block" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="The path forward â€” Charleston dock">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to right,rgba(15,30,69,0.88) 0%,rgba(15,30,69,0.55) 55%,rgba(15,30,69,0.15) 100%)"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:560px;padding:5rem">
    <span style="font-size:0.62rem;letter-spacing:0.35em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(201,169,110,0.65);font-weight:300;margin-bottom:0.8rem;display:block">Our Philosophy</span>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem);font-weight:400;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1.2rem">Every path leads<br>somewhere <em style="font-style:italic;color:#E2C99A">beautiful.</em></h2>
    <div style="width:36px;height:0.5px;background:rgba(201,169,110,0.4);margin-bottom:2rem"></div>
    <blockquote style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.5rem);font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:2rem">"I believe in the power of every person to transform their life, their work, and their world. Vivazia Living exists to walk that path with you."</blockquote>
    <p style="font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-weight:300;margin-bottom:2rem">Founded on the belief that <strong style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-weight:300">every life holds infinite possibility</strong>, Vivazia Living brings together expertise, warmth, and a deeply Brazilian sense of abundance â€” in service of your growth.</p>
    <a href="#contact" style="display:inline-block;background:#C9A96E;color:#0F1E45;padding:0.85rem 2rem;font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-weight:400">Begin Your Journey</a>
  </div>
</section>

